CM k9ay_orig's NAIVE twin (momwire#415): the same expansion with the load
CM left where the card wrote it, on tag 2 alone.  This is the model an engine
CM produces if it expands GX geometrically and then reads LD as if the
CM structure were ordinary -- one load short, and the missing one sits on the
CM driven wire.  Committed so the gap between it and the twin above is
CM measured rather than asserted: it is exactly the load's own 470 ohms.
